<title>SPAIN: Citroen Hispania says can't guarantee Wed output.</title>
<headline>Citroen Hispania says can't guarantee Wed output.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citroen Hispania said it cannot guarantee vehicle production on Wednesday, but today's nightshift is guaranteed to go ahead amid a truckers' strike, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The unit is part of the Peugeot Citroen group.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
